      "A song cycle to lyrics by Nikos Gatsos (Op. 31a, 1975), sung by Manolis Mitsias and Dimitra Galani, with Hadjidakis conducting this time. It includes “I balanta tou Ouri”, “O Giannis o fonias”, “Koita me sta matia” and the title song “Athanasia”. Cover and drawings by Giorgos Stathopoulos."
